.*
.* DSPJRN: a journal's entries; option 5 shows one in full. No golden:
.* the pub400 account owns no journal (title and keys).
:PNLGRP.
:CLASS NAME=OPTCL BASETYPE=ACTION.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=NAMECL BASETYPE='CHAR 10'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=SEQCL BASETYPE='CHAR 10'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=CODECL BASETYPE='CHAR 4'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=TIMECL BASETYPE='CHAR 8'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=VALCL BASETYPE='CHAR 30'.
:ECLASS.
:VAR NAME=JRN CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=JRNLIB CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=LARGEST CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=OPT CLASS=OPTCL.
:VAR NAME=SEQ CLASS=SEQCL.
:VAR NAME=CODE CLASS=CODECL.
:VAR NAME=TYPE CLASS=CODECL.
:VAR NAME=OBJ CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=OBJLIB CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=JOB CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=TIME CLASS=TIMECL.
:VAR NAME=STAMP CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=QJOB CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=MBR CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=COUNT CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=CYCLE CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=DATALEN CLASS=VALCL.
:LISTDEF NAME=ENTRIES VARS='OPT SEQ CODE TYPE OBJ OBJLIB JOB TIME STAMP QJOB MBR COUNT CYCLE DATALEN'.
:KEYL NAME=JEKEYS.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEUP ACTION=PAGEUP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEDOWN ACTION=PAGEDOWN.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:EKEYL.
:PANEL NAME=DSPJRN KEYL=JEKEYS HELP=DSPJRN ENTER='RETURN 1' TOPSEP=SPACE.Display Journal Entries
:DATA DEPTH=3.
:DATACOL WIDTH=40.
:DATAI VAR=JRN USAGE=OUTPUT.Journal
:DATACOL WIDTH=38.
:DATAI VAR=JRNLIB USAGE=OUTPUT.Library
:EDATA.
:DATA DEPTH=1.
:DATAI VAR=LARGEST USAGE=OUTPUT.Largest sequence number on this screen
:EDATA.
:TOPINST.Type options, press Enter.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=ENTRIES.(No entries selected)
:LISTACT OPTION=5 ENTER='RETURN 5'.5=Display entire entry
:LISTCOL VAR=OPT USAGE=INPUT.Opt
:LISTCOL VAR=SEQ USAGE=OUTPUT.Sequence
:LISTCOL VAR=CODE USAGE=OUTPUT.Code
:LISTCOL VAR=TYPE USAGE=OUTPUT.Type
:LISTCOL VAR=OBJ USAGE=OUTPUT.Object
:LISTCOL VAR=OBJLIB USAGE=OUTPUT.Library
:LISTCOL VAR=JOB USAGE=OUTPUT.Job
:LISTCOL VAR=TIME USAGE=OUTPUT.Time
:LISTVIEW COLS='OPT SEQ CODE TYPE OBJ OBJLIB JOB TIME'.
:ELIST.
:EPANEL.
:PANEL NAME=DSPJRNE KEYL=JEKEYS HELP=DSPJRN ENTER='RETURN 1' TOPSEP=SPACE.Display Journal Entry
:DATA DEPTH='*'.
:DATAI VAR=SEQ USAGE=OUTPUT.Sequence
:DATAI VAR=CODE USAGE=OUTPUT.Code
:DATAI VAR=TYPE USAGE=OUTPUT.Type
:DATAI VAR=OBJ USAGE=OUTPUT.Object
:DATAGRP GRPSEP=NONE.
:DATAI VAR=OBJLIB USAGE=OUTPUT.Library
:DATAI VAR=MBR USAGE=OUTPUT.Member
:EDATAGRP.
:DATAI VAR=QJOB USAGE=OUTPUT.Job
:DATAI VAR=STAMP USAGE=OUTPUT.Date and time
:DATAI VAR=COUNT USAGE=OUTPUT.Count or relative record
:DATAI VAR=CYCLE USAGE=OUTPUT.Commit cycle
:DATAI VAR=DATALEN USAGE=OUTPUT.Entry specific data length
:EDATA.
:BOTINST.Press Enter to continue.
:EPANEL.
:HELP NAME=DSPJRN.Display Journal Entries - Help
:P.The entries of a journal's receivers in sequence order, each with
its journal code and entry type, the object it is about, and the job
and time that wrote it. Option 5 shows an entry in full.
:EHELP.
:EPNLGRP.
